{
  "name": "01 – Hello n8n (weather in our cities)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 👋 Step 1 – Hello n8n\n\n1. Click **Execute workflow** / **Execute** (bottom of the screen).\n2. Double-click every node, from left to right. Look at **INPUT** (left) and **OUTPUT** (right).\n3. Change the cities in **Our cities** and run again.\n\n**Question:** Which city is warmer right now?",
        "height": 230,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "8a07a0dc-ac78-4b62-880a-013582abdb0a",
      "name": "Note: Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
